.el .ds Aq '
.TH bhtune-opc 1  "bhtune-opc "
.SH NAME
bhtune\-opc \- Low\-level OPC DA passthrough (diagnostics) via the opcda\-bridge gateway, bypassing the tuning engine entirely
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbhtune\-opc\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Low\-level OPC DA passthrough (diagnostics) via the opcda\-bridge gateway, bypassing the tuning engine entirely
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
bhtune\-opc\-servers(1)
List the OPC DA servers registered on the bridge gateway\*(Aqs host
.TP
bhtune\-opc\-read(1)
Read one or more tags
.TP
bhtune\-opc\-write(1)
Write a value to one tag
.TP
bhtune\-opc\-browse(1)
Browse tags under a path (empty for the top level)
.TP
bhtune\-opc\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
